'''Alolan Grimer''' (Japanese: '''アローラベトベター''' ''Alolan Betbeter'') is a {{ct|Darkness}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

