*'''Sludge Toss''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Koga's Grimer|78}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

